  "goal": "Build the aerobic base and climbing rate for ski touring: sustained uphill effort at your skinning pace, grade changes, then race-pace climbs, with a taper.",
  "audience": "Healthy adults who already walk or hike about 2 hours a week. The treadmill supplies steady climbing; skiing technique, downhill and snow conditions need outdoor time.",
